sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 사용자
    participant UI as Next.js UI
    participant Bridge as MCP HTTP Bridge<br/>(:3001)
    participant MCPS as MCP Server (in-memory)
    participant API as k3s-studio-api<br/>(:9090)
    participant K8S as K8sService
    participant Ollama as Ollama API<br/>(:11434)
    participant K8sAPI as k3s API Server

    Note over User,K8sAPI: [1] UI에서 AI 어시스턴트 배포

    User->>UI: AI 어시스턴트 탭 → 모델/메모리 선택 → 배포 클릭
    UI->>API: POST /api/clusters/{name}/k8s/apply<br/>{ yaml: Namespace+PVC+Ollama+OpenWebUI YAML }
    API->>K8S: applyManifest(clusterName, yaml)
    K8S->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply (ai-system Namespace, Deployments, Services, PVCs)
    K8sAPI-->>K8S: 완료
    K8S-->>API: result=success
    API-->>UI: 완료
    UI-->>User: "AI 어시스턴트 배포가 시작되었습니다" 토스트<br/>Open WebUI: http://nodeIP:30080

    Note over User,K8sAPI: [2] MCP Bridge에서 AI 도구 호출 (Open WebUI Function Call)

    User->>Ollama: Open WebUI에서 "클러스터 목록 보여줘"
    Ollama->>Bridge: POST /tools/list_clusters {}
    Bridge->>MCPS: mcpClient.callTool("list_clusters", {})
    MCPS->>API: GET /api/clusters
    API-->>MCPS: List~ClusterResponse~
    MCPS-->>Bridge: text result
    Bridge-->>Ollama: { result: "• demo-cluster [RUNNING] ..." }
    Ollama-->>User: "현재 실행 중인 클러스터: demo-cluster ..."

    Note over User,K8sAPI: [3] Ollama 모델 설치 (비동기 fire-and-forget)

    User->>Ollama: Open WebUI에서 "qwen2.5-coder:7b 설치해줘"
    Ollama->>Bridge: POST /tools/pull_ollama_model<br/>{ clusterName, model: "qwen2.5-coder:7b" }
    Bridge->>MCPS: mcpClient.callTool("pull_ollama_model", ...)
    MCPS->>Ollama: POST /api/pull { name: "qwen2.5-coder:7b" } [fire-and-forget, timeout=300s]
    Note right of Ollama: 백그라운드 다운로드
    MCPS-->>Bridge: "Pull started for 'qwen2.5-coder:7b'..."
    Bridge-->>Ollama: { result: "Pull started..." }
    Ollama-->>User: "모델 설치를 시작했습니다. list_ollama_models로 확인 가능합니다."

    Note over User,K8sAPI: [4] GET /tools — OpenAI Function Schema 조회

    Ollama->>Bridge: GET /tools
    Bridge->>MCPS: mcpClient.listTools()
    MCPS-->>Bridge: List~ToolDefinition~
    Bridge->>Bridge: MCP schema → OpenAI function format 변환
    Bridge-->>Ollama: [{ type: "function", function: { name, description, parameters } }, ...]
